1
00:00:07,319 --> 00:00:09,774
Earth, come here.

2
00:00:09,774 --> 00:00:11,082
What?
Hurry.

3
00:00:15,896 --> 00:00:16,626
What is it?

4
00:00:16,626 --> 00:00:19,141
What did you do in his room yesterday?

5
00:00:19,141 --> 00:00:19,920
Who?

6
00:00:20,061 --> 00:00:21,006
Night.

7
00:00:21,218 --> 00:00:24,996
Huh? You're calling him "Night" now?

8
00:00:24,996 --> 00:00:26,840
What's wrong with you?

9
00:00:26,840 --> 00:00:29,435
Tell me what you did. Come on.

10
00:00:29,576 --> 00:00:31,612
Did what? I'm confused as hell.

11
00:00:33,322 --> 00:00:37,920
Oh— I left my phone in his room.

12
00:00:39,313 --> 00:00:40,928
You two are close now or what?

13
00:00:42,568 --> 00:00:44,429
Not really. Why?

14
00:00:46,704 --> 00:00:52,261
Forget it. Nothing.
Good then.

15
00:01:00,160 --> 00:01:01,663
Whoa, Gun…

16
00:01:03,338 --> 00:01:07,016
Why don't you put things where they belong?

17
00:01:07,016 --> 00:01:08,220
You don't even throw out trash.

18
00:01:09,472 --> 00:01:11,064
How can you be this messy?

19
00:01:13,092 --> 00:01:16,752
Ugh, just clean it up.
Stop complaining.

20
00:01:17,581 --> 00:01:20,012
And don't vacuum. You're loud.

21
00:01:21,863 --> 00:01:22,366
You jerk…

22
00:01:24,094 --> 00:01:25,953
You're not gonna help me clean at all?

23
00:01:27,399 --> 00:01:29,582
Order food for me. I want noodles— thin ones.

24
00:01:44,739 --> 00:01:50,756
Gun, did you hear that sound? Did you?

25
00:01:52,273 --> 00:01:57,941
You hear that, right?
It's coming from the storage room.

26
00:02:00,604 --> 00:02:04,285
Could it be a rat, maybe?

27
00:02:06,084 --> 00:02:10,151
Are you saying there's a rat
in the storage room?

28
00:02:11,386 --> 00:02:15,000
Yeah. Haven't you ever heard it before?
